{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "2eb362e385c0994fc855fa263d0413ffc5c9b65f45eae37b1c19ab8cc8c3ee50", "ja": "同じ空を見上げて", "zh": "仰望同一片天空", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "11a1c60c73431e37e4b527466f1de9bac8f192d94b535825ebe055396c41c19d", "ja": "劇場の記念日を祝う記念公演、当日。\n晴れ渡る空の下、プロデューサーが気合いを\n入れていると、小鳥と社長もやってくる。\n思い出話を語っているうちに美咲も合流し、\n一同は開演を心待ちにするのだった。", "zh": "剧场纪念日纪念公演的当天。\n万里无云的天空下，制作人正鼓足干劲，\n小鸟和社长也来到了现场。\n大家聊起往事时，美咲也加入了进来，\n所有人都满心期待着开演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "085d02e5f6b85fa364540968ce07d74454e280971742a3d000e87636eddacfd3", "ja": "武道館公演　当日・朝……", "zh": "武道馆公演　当天・早晨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a92ea49906e978bedd7cfd23c94dcf5ba221e4ef6981809bde0af7e53cc5c71d", "ja": "（いよいよ、この日が来た。\nみんなで目指してきた、特別なこの日……）", "zh": "（终于，这一天到来了。\n大家一直以来共同追寻的，特别的这一天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aa974bc7d0c92326853257a2aca195b7a280c723c3dc6c51ea5f54e925f419fa", "ja": "絶対に、成功させないとな……！", "zh": "一定要让它成功才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "28e3412a391e0fd8005b70c536dfbe56595226db3b250fb00f71cfd1126d41a7", "ja": "{$P$}さん。朝早くから\nおひとりで、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。一大早\n您一个人在这，是遇到什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b558f9ea3720b744a39b52abf5a254b69e503c50843002767bdd5b92d63ea47e", "ja": "あっ、音無さん。\nすみません、もうリハーサル始まりますか？", "zh": "啊，音无小姐。抱歉，彩排已经要开始了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "435ed13897fe19c96d4daf588b8e2dbd7d882fbb114a8e27ee2004b5346f6714", "ja": "まだ大丈夫ですけど……それより、張り切るのは\nいいですけど、無理はしちゃダメですからね？", "zh": "还不要紧……比起这个，干劲十足\n固然是好事，但可千万不能勉强自己哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "b818c6d406f86ff9cbc91526d9ae73ecab45bcade700e610e5dbd32f0dd1788b", "ja": "{$P$}さんひとりが\n頑張るんじゃなくて、私たちもいますから。", "zh": "不能只靠{$P$}先生一个人\n努力，还有我们在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c44622cc3845b598119ec049e1d37b21465087fa33ccf63a58d6dd5bbe21de57", "ja": "音無さん……\nはいっ、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "音无小姐……\n好的，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1008_president", "source_sha256": "9c32aea1d55f972a9bb163ce57fefad4a1b8b39c8a95012f43aece505f8f9aab", "ja": "やあ、君！\n音無君もか、奇遇だね。", "zh": "哎呀，是你啊！\n音无你也来了吗，真巧啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "2aa2d21681d5a0e5ed81e3bfc4f05e3e5f7390f8cac29607c667ead01ab7a2c0", "ja": "あら、社長。\nこんな早い時間から、お散歩ですか？", "zh": "哎呀，社长。\n这么早的时间，是在散步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "18376e7db15a6d3bead8fd47d168e7fca13d687543c609154f6fa66fc86660b6", "ja": "うむ。なんだか早く目が覚めてしまってね。\n遠足の前の小学生のような気持ちだよ、はっはっは！", "zh": "嗯。不知怎么的很早就醒了。\n简直就像春游前的小学生一样的心情啊，哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "e35c9d1923689ddb61713ac95b57cbb3fa48f1c9fed7324ea03963d30819cd0e", "ja": "どうだね、君。\n無事、今日のこの日を迎えた気分は。", "zh": "怎么样，君。\n平安迎来今天，感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c7697b6bb402c54f212573797f6eb137e26686785ca6c2919db535c5c4c53942", "ja": "そうですね……\n何とも言えない、晴れやかな気持ちです。", "zh": "是啊……\n这份心情真是难以言喻，格外舒畅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "8ffc51150fccf5cac844a3256190f8e1bfa0f002813b15fabaa6e650b0886e92", "ja": "うむ！　そうだろう、そうだろう。\n君がアイドル諸君と共に、重ねてきた月日……。", "zh": "嗯！是啊，是啊。\n你与偶像们一同度过的岁月……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "acfc8f16e912246534cf4601257c4b268e496373606ca98404cd081c8c67c4d7", "ja": "それを祝うのに、相応しい空だと思わないかね！", "zh": "你不觉得，这片天空很适合用来庆祝那件事吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "389952b5110397db587d27284e9a49573004d563f20969c94e8be493e20730a1", "ja": "はい！\n……本当に、とてもいい天気です！", "zh": "是！\n……今天的天气真的非常好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "08dab9bb4ba1a45a06e9f4ee290f86fdef0b608563bfd58c361446e334457306", "ja": "こうして空を眺めていると、思い出しますね。\n今まで、いろんなことがあったなって……。", "zh": "像这样仰望天空，就会回想起来呢。\n一路走来，发生过好多事情啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "66f82f3915fb0dc1fe746997e281e17e46196599c062e4d2c9c99a8745346687", "ja": "ああ、そうだね。765プロを立ち上げた時の事や、\n最初のアイドル諸君がやってきた事……。", "zh": "啊，是啊。创办765制作事务所时的事，还有最初那批偶像们到来的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "e112c0c6688c4823056fa5be232d50dd574657d97a39fcc9d3f412a618747fc3", "ja": "それから、アイドルをもっと増やす事になりましたね。\n劇場ができて、39プロジェクトが立ち上がって。", "zh": "然后，我们决定再增加更多偶像。剧场建成了，39企划也启动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "feafd8dd5fb3e985d7f9f17633c6083398b0a33d9dba0f358af3324a3e35d397", "ja": "何だか不思議な感じがします。時間というのは、\n過ぎてしまうと、あっという間なんですね……。", "zh": "总觉得有些不可思议。时间这种东西，  \n一旦过去，就会转眼即逝呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1021_102mis", "source_sha256": "b401e1317d8002d48788fc8484926a6a09ce570d728d55158a02d02d9ed865a2", "ja": "音無先輩～！", "zh": "音无前辈——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1ac23a68cc914b6e68ec98a6961fa6ddcd0e8ab262093d422493190f5a3c09de", "ja": "！　あの声は……。", "zh": "！那个声音是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1023_102mis", "source_sha256": "d9f436c78f1db28d5fc9ac6966eb79c2ccb19ec88a43726f26b7d6bb6c59292f", "ja": "みなさん、お疲れ様です！　お話し中すみません、\nリハーサル、そろそろ始まっちゃいますよ。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！打扰一下，你们的排练差不多要开始了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "736bbfb0192caecfee19378f59d59d929b17f884b847003c706f8ac7940875ab", "ja": "お疲れ様です、青羽さん。\nもうそんな時間でしたか。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n已经到这个时间了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1025_101kot", "source_sha256": "3d40858321ab1d70c49eb3b6d28c0a2cd64f45498ea75ecbc84fd022756f8cc2", "ja": "本当、もうこんな時間……。\n空を眺めていただけなのに。", "zh": "真的，已经这么晚了……  \n明明只是看了会儿天空。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "2bd7fb2215cd80db43056abec98388655ec6a53e49083aa0c957395cabacb796", "ja": "いやはや、すっかり話し込んでしまったようだね。\nそれじゃ、我々も会場に向かおうか。", "zh": "哎呀呀，看来不知不觉聊了很久呢。\n那么，我们也去会场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1027_102mis", "source_sha256": "be0e146794191c9153d23f193d595da354d8741a4a4eea6a63d2bb6dfa6e60b3", "ja": "はい♪　ひとりひとり、いろんなことを乗り越えて\nたどり着いた、胸いっぱいの想いと一緒に……。", "zh": "好的♪ 和大家一起克服了种种困难，终于走到了这一步，怀着满满的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1028_102mis", "source_sha256": "381d196b7c5c36570b31688eea9cb6cbbbe2fa2fdd15cafc0b418719279544b8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nアイドルのみんなが待っていますよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，偶像们都在等着您呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0271_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0271_story_intro_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
